{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20807","headline":"寄崔柳州 · 卢仝","name":"寄崔柳州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"使者立取书，叠纸生百忧。\n使君若不信，他时看白头。\n三百六十州，尅情惟柳州。\n柳州蛮天末，鄙夫嵩之幽。\n花落陇水头，各自东西流。\n凛凛长相逐，爲谢池上鸥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20807.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20807","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}